* One 2T2R branch with a real access transistor (IHP SG13G2 HV NMOS, W = 10 um, L = 0.45 um),
* started cold (UIC) with the source line already at V_ref: the shape that ended every run at
* t = 0 with a timestep underflow until 2.3.0's seed rule (va-transient). Card: tech.inc,
* generated by gen_fig5_access.py. With the word line high, the cell bottom sits at
* V_ref + V_s * R_on / (R_LRS1 + R_on) -- 1.6545 V for R_on = 377 ohm.
*
*   va-cli sim circuits/snn/transistor/uic_access.net --model models/snn *       --model models/sg13g2/psp103/psp103.va --tran --report p1
.include tech.inc
Vvp vp  gnd DC 1.75
Vsl sl  gnd DC 1.65
Vwl wl  gnd PULSE(0 3.3 0 1n 1n 249n 1000n)
XG  vp  p1  rram level=0
XA  p1 wl sl gnd hvn_w10000n_l450n_ng1 w=1e-05 l=4.5e-07 nf=1 mult=1 as=3.4e-12 ad=3.4e-12 ps=2.068e-05 pd=2.068e-05 ngcon=2 delvto=0 factuo=1
.tran 0.5n 500n UIC
.end
